/* DFHRESP - EXEC CICS EIBRESP condition codes.                      */
/*                                                                   */
/* %INCLUDE DFHRESP; inside the MAIN procedure, then compare EIBRESP */
/* (or a RESP(var) variable) against named codes:                    */
/*                                                                   */
/*    IF EIBRESP = RESP_NOTFND    THEN ...   bricks mnemonic         */
/*    IF EIBRESP = DFHRESP_NOTFND THEN ...   classic CICS alias      */
/*                                                                   */
/* The DFHRESP(NOTFND) builtin gives the same value at compile time  */
/* without any include. Every code is declared twice with the same   */
/* VALUE. Mirrors runtime/cobolcopy/DFHRESP.cpy and cics/resp.go.    */

